---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Guilherme Figueira — Portfolio
---

{% block header %}
<!-- paste your current INDEX header exactly -->
<header
  class="sticky top-0 z-10 backdrop-blur bg-bgLight/90 dark:bg-bgDark/90 border-b border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark transition-colors duration-150">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-3 grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-center gap-4">
    <a href="#" class="font-medium cursor-pointer">Guilherme Figueira</a>
    <nav class="justify-self-center hidden sm:flex text-sm text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark">
      <a class="px-4 py-1 rounded hover:text-inkLight dark:hover:text-inkDark cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150"
        href="#projects">Game Projects</a>
      <a class="px-4 py-1 rounded hover:text-inkLight dark:hover:text-inkDark cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150"
        href="#about">About</a>
      <a class="px-4 py-1 rounded hover:text-inkLight dark:hover:text-inkDark cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150"
        href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <button id="themeToggle" aria-label="Activate dark mode" aria-pressed="false"
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark bg-white/60 dark:bg-panelDark shadow-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150">
      <img src="assets/sun.svg" alt="" class="block dark:hidden w-5 h-5" />
      <img src="assets/moon.svg" alt="" class="hidden dark:block w-5 h-5" />
    </button>
  </div>
</header>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<!-- paste ALL the content from <main>…</main> of index.html, unchanged -->
<main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
  <!-- Intro -->
  <section id="intro" class="my-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6 items-center">
      <figure>
        <img src="assets/portrait.png" alt="Guilherme Figueira portrait" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy"
          class="w-40 h-30 object-cover object-[50%_20%] rounded-xl2 border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark shadow-card transition-colors duration-150" />
      </figure>

      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight">Guilherme Figueira</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark">
          M.Sc. in <b>Computer Science and Engineering</b> graduate
        </p>
        <!-- Action buttons -->
        <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <!-- Resume -->
          <a href="assets/documents/cv-guilhermefigueira.pdf" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-base font-semibold
           bg-emerald-600 text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 active:bg-emerald-800
           dark:bg-emerald-500 dark:hover:bg-emerald-600 dark:active:bg-emerald-700
           shadow-sm transition cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-400/60"
            title="Open résumé (PDF)">
            <img src="assets/icons/document.svg" alt="" class="w-5 h-5 opacity-95" />
            Resume
          </a>

          <!-- LinkedIn -->
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/grfigueira/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-full
           border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark
           bg-white dark:bg-panelDark/80 text-[#0A66C2] dark:text-[#8ab4f8]
           shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition cursor-pointer
           focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0A66C2]/40" aria-label="LinkedIn" title="LinkedIn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M20.45 20.45h-3.554v-5.59c0-1.333-.027-3.045-1.855-3.045-1.857 0-2.141 1.45-2.141 2.95v5.685H9.34V9h3.41v1.56h.047c.474-.9 1.63-1.85 3.355-1.85 3.59 0 4.25 2.365 4.25 5.44v6.3zM5.337 7.44a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.115 20.45H3.56V9h3.555v11.45z" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- GitHub -->
          <a href="https://github.com/grfigueira" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-full
           border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark
           bg-white dark:bg-panelDark/80 text-black dark:text-white
           shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition cursor-pointer
           focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-black/20 dark:focus:ring-white/30" aria-label="GitHub"
            title="GitHub">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M12 .5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.41c.58.11.8-.25.8-.57v-2.2c-3.26.71-3.95-1.4-3.95-1.4-.53-1.33-1.3-1.68-1.3-1.68-1.06-.74.08-.72.08-.72 1.17.08 1.79 1.21 1.79 1.21 1.04 1.78 2.74 1.26 3.4.96.11-.76.41-1.26.75-1.55-2.6-.3-5.34-1.3-5.34-5.82 0-1.29.46-2.34 1.21-3.17-.12-.3-.52-1.52.11-3.17 0 0 .98-.31 3.2 1.21a11.1 11.1 0 0 1 5.82 0c2.22-1.52 3.2-1.21 3.2-1.21.63 1.65.23 2.87.12 3.17.75.83 1.21 1.88 1.21 3.17 0 4.53-2.74 5.52-5.36 5.82.42.36.8 1.07.8 2.17v3.22c0 .32.21.69.81.57A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5z" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- itch.io -->
          <a href="https://gfigueira.itch.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-full
           border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark
           bg-white dark:bg-panelDark/80 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400
           shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition cursor-pointer
           focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500/40" aria-label="itch.io" title="itch.io">
            <img src="assets/icons/itchdotio.svg" alt="" class="w-5 h-5 dark:invert" />
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Projects -->
  <section id="projects" class="mt-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-medium mb-3">Game Projects</h2>

    <!-- Row 1: three larger cards -->
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- The Naturals' Descent -->
      <a href="projects/the-naturals-descent.html"
        class="group block focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-400/60 rounded-xl2"
        title="Open The Naturals' Descent project page">
        <figure
          class="card relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl2 border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark bg-white/70 dark:bg-panelDark shadow-card cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150 transform transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-[1.01]">
          <div class="relative w-full pt-[56.25%] overflow-hidden">
            <img src="assets/images/TND_new_cover.jpg" alt="The Naturals' Descent cover"
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" poster="assets/images/TND_new_cover.jpg"
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200"
              src="assets/videos/TND.mp4"></video>
          </div>
          <figcaption
            class="p-3 border-t border-lineLight/70 dark:border-lineDark/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-150">
            <h3 class="text-sm m-0">The Naturals' Descent (2024)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark m-0">Action-Adventure puzzle game.</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </a>

      <!-- Forlorn -->
      <a href="projects/forlorn.html"
        class="group block focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-400/60 rounded-xl2"
        title="Open Forlorn project page">
        <figure
          class="card group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl2 border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark bg-white/70 dark:bg-panelDark shadow-card cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150 transform transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-[1.01]">
          <div class="relative w-full pt-[56.25%] overflow-hidden">
            <img src="assets/images/forlorn.png" alt="Forlorn cover"
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" poster="assets/images/forlorn.png"
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200"
              src="assets/videos/forlorn.mp4"></video>
          </div>
          <figcaption
            class="p-3 border-t border-lineLight/70 dark:border-lineDark/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-150">
            <h3 class="text-sm m-0">Forlorn (2024)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark m-0">Fast FPS with platforming. Inspired by Doom.</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </a>

      <!-- Cartoon Campout -->
      <a href="projects/cartooncampout.html"
        class="group block focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-400/60 rounded-xl2"
        title="Open Cartoon Campout project page">
      <figure
        class="card group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl2 border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark bg-white/70 dark:bg-panelDark shadow-card cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150 transform transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-[1.01]">
        <div class="relative w-full pt-[56.25%] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="assets/images/CartoonCampoutLogo.png" alt="Cartoon Campout cover"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[50%_25%]" />
          <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" poster="assets/images/CartoonCampoutLogo.png"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200"
            src="assets/videos/CartoonCampoutVid.mp4"></video>
        </div>
        <figcaption
          class="p-3 border-t border-lineLight/70 dark:border-lineDark/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-150">
          <h3 class="text-sm m-0">Cartoon Campout (2024)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark m-0">Short Mixed Reality portal experiment.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- two smaller centered cards -->
    <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 place-items-center">
      <figure
        class="card group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl2 border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark bg-white/70 dark:bg-panelDark shadow-card max-w-[26rem] w-full cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150 transform transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-[1.01]">
        <div class="relative w-full pt-[56.25%] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="assets/images/ShapeOfSilenceLogo.png" alt="The 7th Floor placeholder"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <figcaption
          class="p-3 border-t border-lineLight/70 dark:border-lineDark/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-150">
          <h3 class="text-sm m-0">The Shape Of Silence (WIP)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark m-0">Narrative puzzle game.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <!-- EasyDialogueEditor -->
      <figure
        class="card group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl2 border border-lineLight dark:border-lineDark bg-white/70 dark:bg-panelDark shadow-card max-w-[26rem] w-full cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150 transform transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-[1.01]">
        <div class="relative w-full pt-[56.25%] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="assets/images/EasyDialogueEditor.png" alt="EasyDialogueEditor placeholder"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" poster="assets/images/EasyDialogueEditor.png"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200"
            src="assets/videos/EasyDialogueEditor.mp4"></video>
        </div>
        <figcaption
          class="p-3 border-t border-lineLight/70 dark:border-lineDark/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-150">
          <h3 class="text-sm m-0">EasyDialogueEditor (2025)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark m-0">A FOSS, lightweight and platform agnostic
            dialogue tree editor for games.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About -->
  <section id="about" class="mt-12">

    <h2 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">About</h2>

    <p class="text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark">
      I'm a 23 year old <b>M.Sc. in Computer Science and Engineering graduate</b> with a passion for game development.
      The
      very concept of using science and engineering for creative expression has always fascinated me.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p class="text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark">
      In the realm of game programming my expertise lies in C++ and C#. Although I have experience with both Unity and
      Unreal Engine, I tend to approach game programming in an engine agnostic way: I like learning how game engine
      architectures work and applying those concepts when working with any engine.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p class="text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark">
      Although I am not yet professionally established in the games industry, I would consider myself a <b>C++/C#
        Generalist Programmer</b>. I have experience with gameplay programming, graphics programming, tools
      development, sound middleware integration, and XR. I would say my strongest suit right now is gameplay
      programming, as it is the area I have most experience in, and I would say I have a knack for attention to detail
      and making smooth and satisfying game feel.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p class="text-mutedLight dark:text-mutedDark">
      I genuinely love to learn new things and take on new challenges, so if you would like to work together, please
      don't hesitate to reach out!
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section id="contact" class="mt-10 mb-28">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <a class="underline cursor-pointer" href="mailto:gr.figueira@proton.me">gr.figueira@proton.me</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
{% endblock %}

{% block after %}
<img src="assets/cat_light.png" alt="cat light"
  class="pointer-events-none select-none fixed bottom-8 right-10 w-48 -rotate-6 block dark:hidden" />
<img src="assets/cat_dark.png" alt="cat dark"
  class="pointer-events-none select-none fixed bottom-8 right-10 w-48 -rotate-6 hidden dark:block" />
{% endblock %}